{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghlobot Shift, you\u2019ll step into a glowing universe where the fate of the Ghlobots (Glowing Ghost Robots) rests on your hands. When the Demon King steals their Queen and scatters their stars across hidden dimensions, the Ghlobots\u2019 only hope is to journey through seven dazzling universes and reclaim the power that fuels their ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each universe is alive with its own charm and challenge: soar through the shimmering skies of Starfield Falls, dive into the bright shores of Cascade Tides, brave the jagged landscapes of Basalt Barrens, and wander the mystical spores of Blightbloom Grove. Survive the icy winds of FrostBite Nebula, face the molten fury of Lavatide Cliffs, and descend into the haunting depths of Stellar Abyss. Every universe contains secret paths, glowing challenges, and hidden stars waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 35 handcrafted levels and 7 unique boss battles, your adventure is filled with surprises at every turn. The hidden stars you collect aren\u2019t just treasures \u2014 they are the lifeblood of the Ghlobots\u2019 journey, empowering their ships and unlocking the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, colorful, and glowing with atmosphere, Ghlobot Shift invites you to explore, discover, and fight for the light of your people. Can you reclaim the stolen stars, free your Queen, and shift the balance back from darkness?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978750?t=1765251448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978750/ab620b90a277d5a9a44d9e6e49954708dd34f8cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765251448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978750/0417333f3d8f5d1e17ab61460cbd9a3add7b216a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765251448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978750/0417333f3d8f5d1e17ab61460cbd9a3add7b216a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765251448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghlobot Shift, you\u2019ll step into a glowing universe where the fate of the Ghlobots (Glowing Ghost Robots) rests on your hands. When the Demon King steals their Queen and scatters their stars across hidden dimensions, the Ghlobots\u2019 only hope is to journey through seven dazzling universes and reclaim the power that fuels their ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each universe is alive with its own charm and challenge: soar through the shimmering skies of Starfield Falls, dive into the bright shores of Cascade Tides, brave the jagged landscapes of Basalt Barrens, and wander the mystical spores of Blightbloom Grove. Survive the icy winds of FrostBite Nebula, face the molten fury of Lavatide Cliffs, and descend into the haunting depths of Stellar Abyss. Every universe contains secret paths, glowing challenges, and hidden stars waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 35 handcrafted levels and 7 unique boss battles, your adventure is filled with surprises at every turn. The hidden stars you collect aren\u2019t just treasures \u2014 they are the lifeblood of the Ghlobots\u2019 journey, empowering their ships and unlocking the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, colorful, and glowing with atmosphere, Ghlobot Shift invites you to explore, discover, and fight for the light of your people. Can you reclaim the stolen stars, free your Queen, and shift the balance back from darkness?</p>","developers":["Jacob Stetka"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descriptio